From 14866b1de07bc8474557396c09f74275e8fb6bf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:01:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): execute pinned owned ELF files through private
 backing

Retain VFS executable identity through fork, unlink, replacement and
exit. Stage immutable bytes through sealed memfds and preserve public
descriptors until successful exec. Validate kernel-selected interpreters
through the existing bounded metadata and namespace owner.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
